{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23883","headline":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 七 · 白居易","name":"劝酒十四首 不如来饮酒七首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫入红尘去，令人心力劳。\n相争两蜗角，所得一牛毛。\n且灭嗔中火，休磨笑里刀。\n不如来饮酒，稳卧醉陶陶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}